      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>This creature has a vaguely humanoid head, the body of a lion, and the wings of a dragon. Its tail ends in long, sharp spikes.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 17, touch 11, flat-footed 15 (+2 Dex, +6 natural, -1 size)</p><p>hp 57 (6d10+24)</p><p>Fort +9, Ref +7, Will +3</p><p>Resist Wind 5, Fire 5</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 30 ft., fly 50 ft. (clumsy)</p><p>Melee bite +10 (1d8+5), 2 claws +10 (2d4+5 plus grab), tail slap +5 (1d8+2)</p><p>Ranged 4 spikes +8 (1d6+5)</p><p>Space 10 ft.; Reach 5 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Breath Weapon (20-ft. cone, 3d8 fire damage, Reflex DC 17 half, usable every 1d4 rounds), Deadly Hold</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 20, Dex 15, Con 18, Int 7, Wis 12, Cha 9</p><p>Base Atk +6; CMB +12; CMD 24 (28 vs. trip)</p><p>Feats Flyby Attack, Hover, Weapon Focus (spikes)</p><p>Skills Fly -3, Perception +9, Survival +4 (+8 tracking); Racial Modifiers +4 Perception, +4 Survival when tracking</p><p>Languages Common</p>"
      }
